{"title":"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/c/97c379bb4c4252465e6faf39510571fa40c6cbb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10(4x - 3) - k(4x - 3) = 16x - 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"275\" height=\"20\" /> is satisfied by all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. What is the value of the real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Trying_x_.3D_1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Trying_x_=_1)\">Solution 1 (Trying x = 1)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Trying x = 1)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Testing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/1/9115dfc504e20de4c3804e20bbe691dda8db87e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10(4 \\times 1 - 3) - k(4 \\times 1 - 3) = 16 \\times 1 - 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"338\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/d/b7d74294fac6485a6e70838699b3188f41e7549f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\times 1 - k \\times 1 = 16 - 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"198\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/adda61b87171e999c97337f29f091a603bf4cfae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 - k = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/5/c25a627cd4cb543dcb35b6f518d14e68bffb59e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 10 - 4 = \\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"130\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For the equations to be satisfied by all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, the coefficients of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> terms must be equal to each other on both sides of the equation. This means:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693985d3dedb6b611d8d0542720a39cc09f4d24a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\times 4 - 4k = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"135\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/e/b0e168364ee5a3ea105c72241b8cef8446109c66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10 \\times 4 - 4k}{4} = \\frac{16}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"143\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/adda61b87171e999c97337f29f091a603bf4cfae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 - k = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/5/c25a627cd4cb543dcb35b6f518d14e68bffb59e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 10 - 4 = \\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"130\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC\" title=\"2025 CSMC\">2025 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018070403\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 121/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1283/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 134/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2646/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,tem